WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.934 --> 00:00:29.137
"Let's have a Game Night!" said Aunt Judy.

2
00:00:29.138 --> 00:00:34.333
"Yes!" cried Emmy and Harry.

3
00:00:34.334 --> 00:00:41.826
First everybody played a board game.

4
00:00:41.827 --> 00:00:44.617
Emmy rolled the dice across the board.

5
00:00:44.618 --> 00:00:51.231
She moved her piece five spaces.

6
00:00:51.232 --> 00:00:54.404
Then Harry took a turn.

7
00:00:54.405 --> 00:01:01.401
"I get to move six spaces!" said Harry.

8
00:01:01.402 --> 00:01:10.631
Everyone took more turns.

9
00:01:10.632 --> 00:01:16.070
Soon Emmy's piece was in the lead.

10
00:01:16.071 --> 00:01:23.285
Emmy rolled the dice again.

11
00:01:23.286 --> 00:01:26.023
"Ugh," said Emmy.

12
00:01:26.024 --> 00:01:39.011
"I have to go back three spaces."

13
00:01:39.012 --> 00:01:44.702
Then Harry moved 12 spaces.

14
00:01:44.703 --> 00:01:49.218
His piece reached Home first.

15
00:01:49.219 --> 00:01:52.580
"I won!" said Harry.

16
00:01:52.581 --> 00:01:54.901
"I'm the best!"

17
00:01:54.902 --> 00:01:59.184
Emmy frowned.

18
00:01:59.185 --> 00:02:04.501
"Be a good sport, Harry," said Mom.

19
00:02:04.502 --> 00:02:08.041
Oliver frowned too.

20
00:02:08.042 --> 00:02:12.411
"I wanted to win!" Oliver whined.

21
00:02:12.412 --> 00:02:21.016
"Be a good sport, Oliver," said Mom.

22
00:02:21.017 --> 00:02:26.359
Next they played a guessing game.

23
00:02:26.360 --> 00:02:29.181
Aunt Judy stood up and clapped her hands.

24
00:02:29.182 --> 00:02:32.160
"Are you at a concert?" asked Harry.

25
00:02:32.161 --> 00:02:41.602
Aunt Judy shook her head but didn't say anything.

26
00:02:41.603 --> 00:02:44.754
"Are you a seal?" asked Emmy.

27
00:02:44.755 --> 00:02:48.136
Aunt Judy nodded silently.

28
00:02:48.137 --> 00:02:52.625
"Yay!" said Emmy. "I'm the best!"

29
00:02:52.626 --> 00:02:56.412
Harry sighed.

30
00:02:56.413 --> 00:03:02.703
"Be a good sport, Emmy," said Mom.

31
00:03:02.704 --> 00:03:07.266
Emmy stood up and flapped her arms.

32
00:03:07.267 --> 00:03:10.576
"Are you a bird?" asked Mom.

33
00:03:10.577 --> 00:03:13.806
Emmy nodded.

34
00:03:13.807 --> 00:03:17.141
"I'm the best!" shouted Mom.

35
00:03:17.142 --> 00:03:19.407
Dad gave Mom a look.

36
00:03:19.408 --> 00:03:26.917
"Be a good sport, honey," he said.
